          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū aho būlingīla būjikū w'ikūmi na būne, tūsangwa tūlī mu nyanza ya Adilia tūkūselengetiagwa kūtwalwa ūko na ūko. Mu būjikū ha gatī a batūmami ba mu meli biganika gīkī begeela kūshika kū sī nyūmu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būponeja lūgoye kūbūlola ū būshimu bo nyanza, būbona būlī gītī makono makūmi abīlī, būja ja ja ha būtongi hado, būponeja hangī; lelo būbona makono ikūmi na atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna īkī bakogoha gīkī tūtizipamīja mu mawe, būponeja mashika ane ū kū numa ya meli; hūna bandya kūlomba gīkī wele ū būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyalīmo lyato ū mu meli, a batūmami būliicha mu nyanza, kūnū bakwigīmbījaga gītī balīhaya kūponeja mashika kū būtongi bo meli, alīyo bakoobaga nzīla ya kūtolokela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Paulo ūng'wīla ū ntaale wa bashilikale igana na a bashilikale; gīkī, “A benaba ūlū batikalile ū mu meli ūmu, mutūpīla nūūlū hado yaya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bashilikale būjitīna ī ngoye ja lyato lyenīlo būlīlekela lyūselengetiwa lījile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wegeela kwela ū būjikū, ū Paulo ūbakomiga pye balye shilīwa; ūhaya gīkī, “Ī lelo lūlī lūshikū lw'ikūmi n'ine mutaalī kūlya shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha nalīmulomba mulye nguno mukūpīla, atīho nūūlū ūmò wing'we ūyo akūjimīīja nūūlū lūywīlī lūmò dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala kūhaya gīko ūsola ngatī, ūnūmba Mulungu kū būtongi wa bose, hūna ūgūmeganya ūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būzalabana pye a bose, būlya shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo twalīmo ū mu meli, twalī banhū magana abīlī na makūmi mpungatī na batandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balya bigeja, bīgeheja ū būdito ī meli; būjiponanja mu nyanza ī ngano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpaanagūka kwa meli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayeela ū būjikū, bījimīīlwa ī sī yenīyo, alīyo būbona ng'walo nebe gwa lūseni, biganika īkūbeelela ūlū bīkoja henaho ī meli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būjitīnagūla ī ngoye, būgaleka mu minzī a mashika, pye na a magobelo; hūna būlinhya itanga līmò gīkī līsole lūyaga; bīlogeja kū ng'walo ī meli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būshika h'ipandī ilebe aho jalī jimanhīgije nyanza ibīlī, ī meli yichimīja ha sī ū kū būtongi yūlemeelwa ū kūsegeja; hūna yūyūtūlwa mahuuli ū kū numa, yandya kūpaanagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bashilikale lyūbizīīla iganiko lya kūbabūlaga pye a batungwa, gīkī atizilonga nūūlū ūmò wa kūjiha na kūtoloka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntaale wa bashilikale igana ūbalemeja ī liganiko lyabo lyenīlo, nguno walī atogilwe kūmpīja ū Paulo. Ūlagīla abo badūgije kūjiha batonge ū kwiponeja bajihe bajile kū ng'walo, bakipīje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 27:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakasaaga būyūdima mabudīka budīka ga mbao, bangī mashikolo gangī gangī ga mu meli. Yūdūlīkana kūpīlīla ha sī nyūmu pye a bose mu gīko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.27.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.27.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
